# Data: Open Database License 1.0

Counts in data/elements.json come from Taginfo and are © OpenStreetMap
contributors. They are available under the Open Database License 1.0:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

# Data: CC BY-SA 2.0

Descriptions in data/elements.json come from OpenStreetMap Wiki tag pages and
are © OpenStreetMap Wiki contributors. They are available under CC BY-SA 2.0:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/

# Images

Image files are not included in this repository. Each image is credited with
its source, author, and license in the image metadata stored in
data/elements.json, and keeps the license stated there. The images are hosted
by Wikimedia Commons and the OpenStreetMap Wiki.
